# Prices as the Market Board moves them (Docs/Design/79-a-staged-economy.md, section 11; Phase 8): the market's three
# largest moves in SHOWN price, any good, with the cause of the move as the Board has it. Facts in hand:
#   topic.item   the good as a match key ("herbs", "meal", else plain words: "salt", "hides", "iron ore")
#   topic.what   the good mid-sentence ("salt", "hides"; "a meal": the lines that need a mass noun leave meal to the
#                older lines with topic.item!=meal), topic.is ("is"/"are", agreeing with it)
#   topic.good   the good's id;  topic.sort  food, drink or goods: a line about eating is said of food only
#   deals        (a speaker's) yes where the speaker's own shop sells the good: a line of "my shelf" needs it
#   sold_out     (a speaker's) yes where that shop has none of the good left: a line of a shelf bought bare needs it
#   topic.bare   (talk.price_cause, a rise) yes where the traveller named bought a shop's last of the good: the townsfolk's
#                "bought the shelf bare" needs it
#   topic.dir    up | down;  topic.price  the list's price in words ("seven pence", "fourteen pence the dozen")
#   topic.cause  players, dump, ripple, caravan, late, raid, harvest, ship, ship_takes, ship_late, ship_lost, event,
#                still (the latest cause runs against the move);  topic.cause_words  the same in words;  topic.ship
#                the ship a ship's cause names
# The shown-price gate: no figure is ever written here; the only price said is #topic.price#. A line that says why a
# price moved tests its topic.cause. Openers hand on to answers keyed on what was said (pair.mem.jk).
#   prices.answer_cause  a rise put down to its cause (jk: trav, late, raid, harvest, ship)
#   prices.answer_glut   a fall from someone selling a heap
#   prices.close         a keeper's bad week, answered

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- A rise, by band and class

rule e8p_up_rich_upper
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.item!=meal self.wealth=rich self.class=upper
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize# dearer? The steward will mention it at dinner, I expect. | One hears #topic.what# #topic.is# dear. The Council will hear of it, no doubt. | Dear #topic.what#. Mother always said the Houses ought to set an example.
then other: prices.answer_easy

rule e8p_up_rich_trade
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.item!=meal self.wealth=rich self.class=middle|lower
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize# at #topic.price#. I'll pay it, but I'll not like it. | Dear #topic.what#. I'll pass it on in my own prices, that's all.
then other: prices.answer_easy

rule e8p_up_comfortable
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.item!=meal self.wealth=comfortable
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize# at #topic.price#. We'll manage, but I noticed. | #topic.price.capitalize# for #topic.what#. Still, there's worse off than us.
then other: prices.answer_complaint

rule e8p_up_fallen
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.item!=meal self.wealth=comfortable|poor self.class=upper
cooldown 1d
say #topic.price.capitalize# for #topic.what#. One economises. Quietly. | Mother would never have paid #topic.price# for #topic.what#. Nor shall I. | We used to buy #topic.what# without thinking. Not at #topic.price#.
then other: prices.answer_complaint

rule e8p_up_poor
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.item!=meal self.wealth=poor
cooldown 1d
say I counted my pennies twice. Still no #topic.what#. | #topic.what.capitalize# at #topic.price#. Who are they selling it to? Not us.
then other: prices.answer_complaint

rule e8p_up_poor_food
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.item!=meal topic.sort=food self.wealth=poor|destitute
cooldown 1d
say #topic.price.capitalize# for #topic.what#. That's my supper gone. | My belly says buy and my purse says no. #topic.price.capitalize#. | I'd eat #topic.what# off the stall if they'd let me.
then other: prices.answer_complaint

rule e8p_up_destitute
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.item!=meal self.wealth=destitute
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize#? I'd not know. I've no pennies to look with. | Dear, is it? Everything's dear when you've nothing.
then other: prices.answer_complaint

rule e8p_up_any
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize# #topic.is# dear just now. #topic.price.capitalize#. | Have you priced #topic.what#? #topic.price.capitalize#, now.
then other: prices.answer_complaint

rule e8p_up_tavern
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.item!=meal here.place=tavern
cooldown 1d
say Here's to #topic.what# at #topic.price#. May it choke the seller. | Talk of anything but #topic.what#. I'm drinking to forget it.
then other: prices.answer_complaint

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- A fall, by band and class

rule e8p_down_rich_upper
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down topic.item!=meal self.wealth=rich self.class=upper
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize# cheaper? I'd not noticed. The household sees to that. | One hears #topic.what# #topic.is# cheap. How nice for the town.
then other: prices.answer_cheap

rule e8p_down_rich_trade
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down topic.item!=meal self.wealth=rich self.class=middle|lower
cooldown 1d
say Cheap #topic.what#. I'll lay in a cartload while it lasts. | Money's made buying, not selling. I'll have some #topic.what# at #topic.price#.
then other: prices.answer_cheap

rule e8p_down_comfortable
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down topic.item!=meal self.wealth=comfortable
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize# at #topic.price#. I'll get a little extra in. | Cheap #topic.what#. Mind, I'll believe it when I've paid it.
then other: prices.answer_cheap

rule e8p_down_poor
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down topic.item!=meal self.wealth=poor
cooldown 1d
say #topic.price.capitalize#! I can have #topic.what# this week. | #topic.what.capitalize# down. First good word all month.
then other: prices.answer_cheap

rule e8p_down_poor_pups
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down topic.item!=meal topic.sort=food self.wealth=poor self.parent=yes
cooldown 1d
say Cheaper #topic.what#. The pups'll eat. | #topic.what.capitalize# at #topic.price#. The little ones'll have a full bowl.
then other: prices.answer_cheap

rule e8p_down_destitute
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down topic.item!=meal self.wealth=destitute
cooldown 1d
say Cheap or dear, I've not a penny for #topic.what#. | Cheaper's no good to an empty purse.
then other: prices.answer_cheap

rule e8p_down_any
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize# #topic.is# cheap just now. #topic.price.capitalize#. | Have you seen #topic.what#? Down to #topic.price#.
then other: prices.answer_cheap

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- Why it moved: the Board's cause, said right

rule e8p_c_players_up
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.cause=players topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say Travellers buying it up. #topic.what.capitalize# at #topic.price# now. | The travellers are buying #topic.what# like there's no tomorrow.
then other: prices.answer_cause
remember pair: jk=trav 2m

rule e8p_c_players_down
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down topic.cause=players topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say Travellers selling #topic.what# to the shops. Down to #topic.price#. | Some traveller's been selling the shops #topic.what#.
then other: prices.answer_cheap

rule e8p_c_dump
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down topic.cause=dump topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say Someone sold the shops a heap of #topic.what#. #topic.price.capitalize# now. | A whole heap of #topic.what# came over the counter. Cheap as you like.
then other: prices.answer_glut

rule e8p_c_ripple_up
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.cause=ripple topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize# #topic.is# dear. The makers want more of it, they say. | All the workshops want #topic.what# at once. #topic.price.capitalize#.
then other: prices.answer_complaint

rule e8p_c_ripple_down
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down topic.cause=ripple topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize# cheaper. Plenty of what goes into it, I hear.
then other: prices.answer_cheap

rule e8p_c_caravan
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down topic.cause=caravan topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say The wagon came in. #topic.what.capitalize# at #topic.price# again. | Wagon's in, and #topic.what# with it. Cheaper.
then other: prices.answer_cheap

rule e8p_c_late
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.cause=late topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say The wagon's late, and #topic.what# with it. #topic.price.capitalize#. | No wagon, no #topic.what#. #topic.price.capitalize# till it comes.
then other: prices.answer_cause
remember pair: jk=late 2m

rule e8p_c_raid
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.cause=raid topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say The wagon was robbed on the road. #topic.what.capitalize# #topic.is# dear for it. | #bandits.capitalize# took the #topic.what#. Now it's #topic.price#.
then other: prices.answer_cause
remember pair: jk=raid 2m

rule e8p_c_harvest_down
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down topic.cause=harvest topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say A good harvest. #topic.what.capitalize# at #topic.price#. | The farm carts came in heavy. Cheap #topic.what#.
then other: prices.answer_cheap

rule e8p_c_harvest_up
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.cause=harvest topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say A short harvest. #topic.what.capitalize# #topic.is# dear. | The farm carts came in light. #topic.price.capitalize# now.
then other: prices.answer_cause
remember pair: jk=harvest 2m

rule e8p_c_ship
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down topic.cause=ship topic.ship topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.ship.capitalize# came in. #topic.what.capitalize# at #topic.price#. | A ship in, and #topic.what# cheaper for it.
then other: prices.answer_cheap

rule e8p_c_ship_takes
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.cause=ship_takes topic.ship topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.ship.capitalize#'s buying #topic.what#. Dear here now. | The ship's taking all the #topic.what# it can get. #topic.price.capitalize#.
then other: prices.answer_cause
remember pair: jk=ship 2m

rule e8p_c_ship_late
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.cause=ship_late topic.ship topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.ship.capitalize#'s stormbound. #topic.what.capitalize# at #topic.price#. | No ship, no #topic.what#. Storms.
then other: prices.answer_cause
remember pair: jk=ship 2m

rule e8p_c_ship_lost
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.cause=ship_lost topic.ship topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.ship.capitalize# was lost at sea, and #topic.what# with her. | A ship lost, and folk grumbling about #topic.what#. Shame on us.
then other: prices.answer_cause
remember pair: jk=ship 2m

rule e8p_c_event
when concept=talk.prices topic.cause=event topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize# at #topic.price#. It's all the talk of #topic.cause_words#. | #topic.what.capitalize# at #topic.price#. Ask anyone: #topic.cause_words#.
then other: prices.answer_cause

rule e8p_c_still_up
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up topic.cause=still topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize# still dear, #topic.cause_words#. | #topic.price.capitalize#, still. You'd think it'd have come down by now.
then other: prices.answer_complaint

rule e8p_c_still_down
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down topic.cause=still topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize# cheap still, #topic.cause_words#. | Still #topic.price#. I keep waiting for it to turn.
then other: prices.answer_cheap

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- Keepers of the goods (deals: their shop sells it)

rule e8p_keep_up_thriving
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up role=merchant deals=yes business=thriving topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize# at #topic.price#, and still they buy. I'll not grumble. | My #topic.what# goes out the door at #topic.price#. Ask me how I feel.
then other: prices.answer_easy

rule e8p_keep_up_failing
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=up role=merchant deals=yes business=failing topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say Dearer #topic.what#, and still nobody comes in. | #topic.price.capitalize#, they say, and walk on. My shelves know it.
then other: prices.close

rule e8p_keep_down
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down role=merchant deals=yes topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.what.capitalize# down to #topic.price#. My shelf's worth less than this morning. | I bought #topic.what# dear and sell it cheap. That's trade, they tell me.
then other: prices.answer_undercut

rule e8p_keep_down_thriving
when concept=talk.prices topic.dir=down role=merchant deals=yes business=thriving topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say Cheaper #topic.what#, and they're queuing for it. I'll take that. | Down to #topic.price#, and selling twice as fast.
then other: prices.answer_cheap

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- Answers: a rise and its cause

rule e8p_ans_cause_plain
when concept=prices.answer_cause
say That'll be it. | Is that so. | Makes sense, I suppose.

rule e8p_ans_cause_rich
when concept=prices.answer_cause wealth=rich
say Is that the reason? How tiresome. | Then it'll pass. These things do.

rule e8p_ans_cause_poor
when concept=prices.answer_cause wealth=poor|destitute
say Whatever the reason, my purse pays it. | Knowing why doesn't make it cheaper.

rule e8p_ans_cause_trav
when concept=prices.answer_cause pair.mem.jk=trav
say Travellers. Coin in their purses and none in ours. | They'll move on. The price'll follow them out.

rule e8p_ans_cause_trav_merchant
when concept=prices.answer_cause pair.mem.jk=trav role=merchant
say And I'm glad of them. Travellers pay. | Don't drive them off. They keep my door open.

rule e8p_ans_cause_late
when concept=prices.answer_cause pair.mem.jk=late
say It'll come. Wagons always come, in the end. | Late's better than robbed.

rule e8p_ans_cause_late_carter
when concept=prices.answer_cause pair.mem.jk=late job=carter
say Roads are roads. You try driving them. | The wagon comes when the road lets it.

rule e8p_ans_cause_raid
when concept=prices.answer_cause pair.mem.jk=raid
say #bandits.capitalize# get bolder every season. | Somebody should clear that road. | I hope the carter came home whole, at least.

rule e8p_ans_cause_raid_guard
when concept=prices.answer_cause pair.mem.jk=raid role=guard
say The Watch knows. There's a bounty on the board. | We'll have them. Give it time.

rule e8p_ans_cause_harvest
when concept=prices.answer_cause pair.mem.jk=harvest
say Light carts. Old story. | Pray the next one's better. | The farmers feel it worse than us.

rule e8p_ans_cause_harvest_farmer
when concept=prices.answer_cause pair.mem.jk=harvest job=farmer|herder
say Don't blame the farm. We sent what the field gave. | You should see the fields. I've seen better years.

rule e8p_ans_cause_ship
when concept=prices.answer_cause pair.mem.jk=ship
say The sea gives and the sea keeps. | Ships come in their own time. | Pity the crews more than the price.

rule e8p_ans_cause_ship_sailor
when concept=prices.answer_cause pair.mem.jk=ship job=sailor
say You've not been out in that weather. I have. | The sea doesn't care what #topic.what# costs.

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- Answers: a glut sold in, a keeper's bad week

rule e8p_glut_plain
when concept=prices.answer_glut
say Somebody wanted coin fast. | Buy now, then. | It'll go back up once it's sold through.

rule e8p_glut_merchant
when concept=prices.answer_glut role=merchant deals=yes
say And I'm the one holding a shelf of it. | I paid the old price. Now look.

rule e8p_glut_poor
when concept=prices.answer_glut wealth=poor|destitute
say Good. I'll have some, then. | One wolf's glut, another wolf's bargain.

rule e8p_glut_guard
when concept=prices.answer_glut role=guard
say A heap, all at once? I'll ask where it came from. | Sold in a heap. The Watch likes to know who by.

rule e8p_close_plain
when concept=prices.close
say It'll turn. | Chin up. | Hm. I'm sorry.

rule e8p_close_warm
when concept=prices.close warmth=warm
say I'll come by your shop this week. | Keep your door open. Folk come back.

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- A traveller bought it up (price_cause, up)

# (A shelf "bought bare", "all" of a good bought up: said only where that traveller's buying took a shop's last of it
# (`topic.bare`). A piece or two off a full shelf has been bought, and made it dearer; no more is said of it.)
rule e8p_pc_up_named
when concept=talk.price_cause topic.dir=up topic.known=yes topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.who# has been buying the #topic.what#. #topic.price.capitalize# now. | Ask #topic.who# why #topic.what# #topic.is# dear.
then other: prices.answer_cause
remember pair: jk=trav 2m

rule e8p_pc_up_named_bare
when concept=talk.price_cause topic.dir=up topic.known=yes topic.bare=yes topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.who# bought up the #topic.what#. #topic.price.capitalize# now. | Ask #topic.who# why #topic.what# #topic.is# dear. Bought the shelf bare.
then other: prices.answer_cause
remember pair: jk=trav 2m

rule e8p_pc_up_look
when concept=talk.price_cause topic.dir=up topic.known=no topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say A stranger has been buying #topic.what#. #topic.who#, it was. | #topic.who# came buying #topic.what#. Dear now.
then other: prices.answer_cause
remember pair: jk=trav 2m

rule e8p_pc_up_look_bare
when concept=talk.price_cause topic.dir=up topic.known=no topic.bare=yes topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say A stranger bought up all the #topic.what#. #topic.who#, it was. | #topic.who# bought the shelf bare of #topic.what#. Dear now.
then other: prices.answer_cause
remember pair: jk=trav 2m

# (A keeper says its shelf was cleared only where it was: `sold_out`, none of the good left in its own shop. A dozen
# loaves bought off a full shelf is good custom, never "cleared out".)
rule e8p_pc_up_merchant
when concept=talk.price_cause topic.dir=up role=merchant deals=yes topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.who# has been buying my #topic.what#. Good custom. | #topic.who# came for #topic.what# and paid what I asked. I'll take that kind of morning.
then other: prices.answer_cause
remember pair: jk=trav 2m

rule e8p_pc_up_merchant_bare
when concept=talk.price_cause topic.dir=up role=merchant deals=yes sold_out=yes topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.who# bought my #topic.what# to the last. Good custom. | Cleared out of #topic.what# by #topic.who#. I'll take that kind of morning.
then other: prices.answer_cause
remember pair: jk=trav 2m

rule e8p_pc_up_poor
when concept=talk.price_cause topic.dir=up wealth=poor|destitute topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
say #topic.who# bought up the #topic.what# and left us the price. | Lovely for #topic.who#. The rest of us pay #topic.price#.
then other: prices.answer_cause
remember pair: jk=trav 2m

scene e8p_pc_up_who
when topic=price_cause topic.dir=up topic.item!=meal
cooldown 1d
a : Who's buying all the #topic.what#? | #topic.what.capitalize# #topic.is# #topic.price# now. Do you know why?
b : #topic.who#. I watched it happen. | #topic.who#, from what I hear.
a : Much good may it do #topic.who#. | Then I'll wait till it comes down.

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- Two of different means

scene e8p_sc_rich_poor_up
when topic=prices topic.dir=up topic.item!=meal a.wealth=rich b.wealth=poor|destitute
cooldown 1d
a : #topic.what.capitalize# #topic.is# dearer, my steward says. | One hears #topic.what# #topic.is# up.
b : It is, for some of us. | Up, and staying up.
a[warmth=warm] : I'd no idea. I'm sorry. Truly.
a : How trying for you.

scene e8p_sc_poor_keeper_up
when topic=prices topic.dir=up topic.item!=meal a.wealth=poor|destitute b.role=merchant b.deals=yes
cooldown 1d
a : #topic.price.capitalize# for #topic.what#? You've a nerve. | Can't you do #topic.what# any cheaper?
b[business=failing] : I'd sell it cheaper if I could. Look at my shelves. Nobody's buying.
b : It's the price on the list. Same for everyone. | Not a penny less, I'm afraid.
a : Then I'll go without. | Worth asking.

scene e8p_sc_comfortable_down
when topic=prices topic.dir=down topic.item!=meal topic.sort=food a.wealth=comfortable
cooldown 1d
a : #topic.what.capitalize# at #topic.price#. I'll lay some by. | Cheap #topic.what#. We'll have a little extra on the table.
b[wealth=poor|destitute] : Lay some by for me too, while you're at it.
b[wealth=rich] : Is it? I leave all that to the cook.
b : Good thinking. | Lucky you.

scene e8p_sc_upper_trade_up
when topic=prices topic.dir=up topic.item!=meal a.wealth=rich a.class=upper b.wealth=rich b.class=middle|lower
cooldown 3d
weight 0.25
a : #topic.what.capitalize# #topic.is# dear, I'm told. Is it hurting trade? | The Council talked of #topic.what# yesterday. Over the wine.
b : Trade takes its knocks. It'll mend. | Over the wine. Of course.
a : Do let me know if the Houses can help. | Where else?

## ---------------------------------------------------------------- Barks: the list's price, by those who live by it

rule e8p_bk_baker_up
when concept=bark job=baker world.bread_price=up
cooldown 6h
say Bread's dear, I know. Don't look at me like that. | Fresh loaves! Dearer, but fresh!

rule e8p_bk_baker_down
when concept=bark job=baker world.bread_price=down
cooldown 6h
say Cheap loaves today! Come and get them! | Bread's down! Buy two!

rule e8p_bk_fish_down
when concept=bark job=fisher world.fish_price=down
cooldown 6h
say Fish going cheap! Can't give it away! | Cheap fish, and my nets full. Lovely for you.

rule e8p_bk_fish_up
when concept=bark job=fisher world.fish_price=up
cooldown 6h
say Fish is dear, and I'm the one getting wet for it. | Fresh fish! Dear, and worth it!

rule e8p_bk_ale_up
when concept=bark job=brewer|innkeeper world.ale_price=up
cooldown 6h
say Ale's dear this week. Drink it slower. | Dear ale, same mugs. Don't start.

rule e8p_bk_ale_down
when concept=bark job=brewer|innkeeper world.ale_price=down
cooldown 6h
say Cheap ale! Bring your friends! | Ale's cheap. A good week to be thirsty.

rule e8p_bk_salt_up
when concept=bark world.salt_price=up
cooldown 1d
say Dear salt. The fish won't keep, and nor will I. | Salt's dear. Everything'll taste of nothing.

rule e8p_bk_cheese
when concept=bark world.cheese_price=up wealth=rich
cooldown 1d
say Cheese, dear? One shall have to have it anyway. | They want what for cheese now? Never mind. Wrap it.

rule e8p_bk_smith_ore
when concept=bark job=smith world.iron_ore_price=down
cooldown 6h
say Cheap ore. I'm working the new ore today. | Plenty of ore in. I'll be at the forge till dark.

rule e8p_bk_smith_nails
when concept=bark job=smith world.nails_price=up
cooldown 6h
say Nails dear? Then the forge stays hot. | Dear nails. Good for the anvil, bad for the roofers.

rule e8p_bk_cook_up
when concept=bark job=cook|innkeeper world.meal_price=up
cooldown 6h
say Hot meals! Dearer, I know, but hot! | Stew's up. Still the best in town.

rule e8p_bk_poor_bread
when concept=bark wealth=poor|destitute world.bread_price=up
cooldown 1d
say Bread's dear again. #oath#. | Dear bread. Thin soup tonight.

rule e8p_bk_healer_herbs
when concept=bark job=healer world.herbs_price=down
cooldown 6h
say Herbs cheap this week. Come now, while I can treat you cheap. | Cheap herbs! Bring me your coughs!

rule e8p_bk_wagons_late
when concept=bark world.wagons=late role=merchant
cooldown 6h
say Still no wagon. I'm selling what's in the back room. | Wagon's late. Ask me again tomorrow.

rule e8p_bk_wagons_raided
when concept=bark world.wagons=raided
cooldown 6h
say Robbed on the road again, the wagon. #oath#. | Another wagon robbed. Who'll drive the next one?
